features.body:
The check lists errors, warnings and notes, such as:

- a blank family name, or no glyphs;
- impossible metrics (ascender not above descender…);
- unencoded glyphs without a valid name;
- feature code that doesn't compile;
- Latin letters without a **space** glyph;
- points that sit a unit or two off a metric line;
- with several masters, a reminder that a single export uses only the active one.

Clean fonts export straight through; warnings ask once, defaulting to Cancel.

steps.code:
@font-face {
  font-family: "My Font";
  src: url("/fonts/MyFont-Regular.woff2") format("woff2");
  font-weight: 400;
  font-display: swap;
}

body { font-family: "My Font", sans-serif; }

for glyph in CurrentFont().selectedGlyphs:
    glyph.leftMargin = 40
    glyph.rightMargin = 40
